  - speakerName: "T\xF4i"
    text: "...Ch\u1EAFc ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ta ngh\u0129 nhi\u1EC1u qu\xE1 th\xF4i. Ng\u1EE7
      \u0111\xE3, m\u1EC7t qu\xE1 r\u1ED3i."
    questToGive:
      questId: di_ngu
